# Density Compare
# Ytterbium (Yb) — real density 6.9 g/cm³. equal masses: Ytterbium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Ytterbium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.5mm color: #bfbfe8 at (-20mm, 5.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 55.0 g — the water cube is the reference
